#: scenario:scenario_B85E47A8_2A5C_4EAB_B10B_A58D1633E893
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 54f6be0004b8de2d84c6439a505016fa2780e094514faf520506acc2cfc95dcb
#. default-sha256: 7fb545d5bc9bb3798cd5759ed7d3ae7344f15fd627abcc9f8f6e5e72f86b064a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B85E47A8_2A5C_4EAB_B10B_A58D1633E893"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫Slowly but surely, time trekked onward, everyone working toward their own individual goals."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫Lenta mas seguramente, o tempo avançava, todos trabalhando em direção a seus objetivos "
"individuais."

#: scenario:scenario_D2036877_CB64_4A97_8B0F_4D65C53B3156
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aa8f2364db798b5a2cddda596dba4de5e8f785c5c43e160640918554dc8e03d9
#. default-sha256: b90efba5d0d276559e26557257bb802bee7789dfad79f48ba18ef06c83f07936
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D2036877_CB64_4A97_8B0F_4D65C53B3156"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Each early-summer breeze that blew through the garden was like God’s hallowed breath "
"carrying the flowers’ fragrance in through Rose Manor’s windows."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Cada brisa do início do verão que soprava pelo jardim era como o hálito sagrado de Deus "
"transportando a fragrância das flores pelas janelas da Mansão das Rosas."

#: scenario:scenario_9A4DE7BB_0C12_411E_AE8C_2E488320BDE2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8daa16c9728f60e3ce0aaa3d1343608a3054677a40b9e6b288311e202899f05e
#. default-sha256: 8aad5f35461290274ce82d2b7917d75e207443b3223e99238187f9fcbb5a2a3b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_9A4DE7BB_0C12_411E_AE8C_2E488320BDE2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If only time could be stopped, and this beautiful era made to live on through eternity."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Se ao menos o tempo pudesse ser parado, e esta bela era vivesse pela eternidade."

#: scenario:scenario_C8801846_7252_4B91_84FD_916BE74A68A7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 48743b4b3804a4cf8c8be70a68333ea231f67ededf49bac21700c78740c822d0
#. default-sha256: 79a58cff5e81800c962707c2b18b2d9439182d132fc5226cfada775f84523059
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_C8801846_7252_4B91_84FD_916BE74A68A7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As usual, Mell’s eyes chased after the White-Haired Girl, and Nellie pursed her lips in "
"frustration at him. ⟪k:1⟫But she was still rather docile."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Como de costume, os olhos de Mell perseguiam a Garota de Cabelos Brancos, e Nellie franzia "
"os lábios em frustração. ⟪k:1⟫Mas ela ainda era bastante dócil."

#: scenario:scenario_413EE96A_C6D7_4B31_8421_5DE9B5B6592E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3928caea4e86c5ab3047c211fa89ed73628f56a3e884422afee037a7223bef32
#. default-sha256: ca7775ef1f4142da2c2e4b82831a18351fe033dacb4a57c792e2eaa7cd03c8a9
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_413EE96A_C6D7_4B31_8421_5DE9B5B6592E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Even taking into account how self-centered she behaved, how fickle her temper, Nellie’s fits "
"were still no worse than a playful kitten."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mesmo levando em conta o quão egocêntrica ela se comportava, quão inconstante era seu "
"temperamento, os ataques de Nellie ainda não eram piores do que uma gatinha brincalhona."

#: scenario:scenario_5D308507_DC8D_4784_9099_C7E5E1924E30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4345c3b70030b348d148d6f17d7cd23510e00c059a70f01eb9904ac072440383
#. default-sha256: e05a87b215dde592d65f9913227556cb12cc8dcd462654c502090df8ed64dfcc
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_5D308507_DC8D_4784_9099_C7E5E1924E30"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫See? At that very moment, our lively little feline had her claws poised to swat at the "
"flaxen-haired young man."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Vê? Naquele exato momento, nossa vivaz felina estava com as garras prontas para golpear o "
"jovem de cabelos cor de linho."

#: scenario:scenario_FD95A642_51F8_40B0_8FBA_93F6CCA6FA16
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6190eb101b53e677b83afe964a78084601e13444332c436de3bd63e17d8553c1
#. default-sha256: 95e2dfc39cf1a46b74c932911135405b3240cb7c0ca11eda004bb8ff66af9d17
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_FD95A642_51F8_40B0_8FBA_93F6CCA6FA16"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Hehehe."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Hehehe."

#: scenario:scenario_DBE9B976_12DB_4DBB_8E83_7FC83F259946
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c92e7f77815fd6b591c4d4061f96dc8658110175bff09d74ae1056554f360a1f
#. default-sha256: 10b1a7f1fe9b499bda81e88fec63a970437774865f84cb46151f372c65b734c8
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_DBE9B976_12DB_4DBB_8E83_7FC83F259946"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Mell!⟪k:9⟫You promised me!⟪k:10⟫Or have you "
"forgotten?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Mell!⟪k:9⟫Você me prometeu!⟪k:10⟫Ou você esqueceu?!"

#: scenario:scenario_DD3F9AE7_91E2_400A_8840_9D8ED4C66C53
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb61d9cdc0fc4d75b2d11a7521bdde79832244486088c58b11dfd5e159473f4e
#. default-sha256: 025239d55a6782fba259dd4a066c988fb6f47bce23546a104755943c17bfdb2d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_DD3F9AE7_91E2_400A_8840_9D8ED4C66C53"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I haven’t forgotten, I’m just asking if we can go another day."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eu não esqueci, só estou perguntando se podemos ir outro dia."

#: scenario:scenario_DB64EEF5_3153_4721_80BE_6A8D3C452F51
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d92ca37bc72d64d0d67de4ce8d753b8fdc8eeddb98817c95c118b76b8e34f359
#. default-sha256: a37b55f86be1d2cb825377ebf711835dc10f9e33ba234dc39d3ab41e5f664419
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_DB64EEF5_3153_4721_80BE_6A8D3C452F51"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Another day?⟪k:3⟫ This isn’t something that happens every day!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I’ve been "
"looking forward to tonight’s performance for so long."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Outro dia?⟪k:3⟫ Isso não é algo que acontece todos os dias!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Estou ansiosa "
"pela apresentação desta noite há tanto tempo."

#: scenario:scenario_64CBF9EE_F404_48E3_BA36_662BC330EF22
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 66d01e6fc2b457133e7435d7e6356827f302b579732dcad08f5dae7df07e6f41
#. default-sha256: 094f80a84ce4d0f5f343fc23d9b0608f0e1c3312202fcb0f114c282e42b02d13
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_64CBF9EE_F404_48E3_BA36_662BC330EF22"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫There’s nothing I can do about that. We’re having a gathering at the priest’s home "
"tonight. ⟪k:2⟫Several high-ranking officials have come up from the mainland just for this."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Não há nada que eu possa fazer sobre isso. Vamos ter uma reunião na casa do sacerdote "
"esta noite. ⟪k:2⟫Vários oficiais de alto escalão vieram do continente apenas para isso."

#: scenario:scenario_A4ED2DE1_002E_4D59_91D2_FDE757FC6D54
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5f95a4e97724e71ed8f7a2c7501a09e475d08695cbe382fc2b266f756d80e63e
#. default-sha256: 39a18b4dece608887b383690ce40086153366e09baf9545b4b2173a14c49a8be
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A4ED2DE1_002E_4D59_91D2_FDE757FC6D54"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Who cares?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Quem se importa?!"

#: scenario:scenario_2ECAF814_92B5_4FCA_9A2C_BA4FE44F2586
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0340b0b47cde7afea7dedca3a031354daaaa3c7ca96da4178d88b0064ec9110e
#. default-sha256: 2bcad43b8416fd8b4df8cdb98508ad85a089b92362fdad33c7c4191ee695fecf
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2ECAF814_92B5_4FCA_9A2C_BA4FE44F2586"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I-⟪k:2⟫I care...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You know, Nellie... ⟪k:5⟫it doesn’t ⟪k:6⟫have⟪k:7⟫ to be me "
"who goes with you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Eu-⟪k:2⟫Eu me importo...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Sabe, Nellie...⟪k:5⟫não precisa ⟪k:6⟫ser eu⟪k:7⟫ a "
"acompanhá-la."

#: scenario:scenario_01CE9B15_4BDF_445A_B799_9227D376C28C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 119caf9c0c370d3ae33919ad99d1c73573d11133da8be931807467417b24b4b3
#. default-sha256: aab85169f6510fca79f945623f1d462d94a82e5eb42844e4920b8f740f2290d9
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_01CE9B15_4BDF_445A_B799_9227D376C28C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫No! I want to go with you, Mell!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Não! Eu quero ir com você, Mell!"

#: scenario:scenario_C8F83018_7993_4DEB_87D4_A32FD1F60C4A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7ced5e6cb21161a21fd6bc73a6cc798b9de238a4de122fbfcb481fe9ab66e1c8
#. default-sha256: a624d26a55da1f654f3cee4dbcd7e95d7bf6d0594cf4f049c75ef5169ddc00da
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_C8F83018_7993_4DEB_87D4_A32FD1F60C4A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You’ve been so distant lately, dearest Mell.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You refuse to do anything with "
"me..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Você tem estado tão distante ultimamente, querido Mell.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Você se recusa a fazer "
"qualquer coisa comigo..."

#: scenario:scenario_1B36894A_FFC7_4F9A_B2F9_50D0F1E37722
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f1dd50d2d38ad9e0e0c8840578ad1a7a7ac42c48ff7217d8abe482236288cacb
#. default-sha256: 60bddbb9ad31b9e5ebbffb71dfc34ccc128054786598c14e0fd4d3374c7d7722
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1B36894A_FFC7_4F9A_B2F9_50D0F1E37722"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That’s not true."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Isso não é verdade."

#: scenario:scenario_0B4E29E2_F75F_4C33_B0C7_FB7A63F16B56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c1f83f9f73512f48b8488c4e1d84fffa5015014c1ad46ac79ba98079ed841802
#. default-sha256: 2c7c1ca563d35ef1d1d11a5bcd0d9d76422bec44dca2fb892820464648d846da
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0B4E29E2_F75F_4C33_B0C7_FB7A63F16B56"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Tell me—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫if you can’t go today, when ⟪k:4⟫can⟪k:5⟫ you?⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫When will you "
"be willing to go out with me?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Conte-me — ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫se você não pode ir hoje, ⟪k:4⟫quando⟪k:5⟫ pode?⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Quando "
"você estará disposto a sair comigo?"

#: scenario:scenario_4C33E21F_95D7_4D67_A60C_4A7B5FA336B8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 113e27715882ce232b0ed19c4af690e1710f2aedbd04658224196ca19c7c8eec
#. default-sha256: 0f5ccce8806637796f5bffd148cc76d81ad88b27255f0b4a416e8bccecc69b52
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_4C33E21F_95D7_4D67_A60C_4A7B5FA336B8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫When will you be willing to play cards with me?⟪k:1⟫To have tea together?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Quando você estará disposto a jogar cartas comigo?⟪k:1⟫Para tomar chá juntos?"

#: scenario:scenario_9385E4E7_E567_4872_B6EA_244B62C0B2D2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f381327e2b6d037d7806a6299d69b6ec64e802a5d05c5445f9204b817f2145f1
#. default-sha256: dff29199e956eb030c7e161661116dc51f6961ef1ae6c125b853fd6fd48d7a66
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_9385E4E7_E567_4872_B6EA_244B62C0B2D2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I... ⟪k:2⟫can’t make any promises.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I have things to do—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫obligations."
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫And Nellie, you’re almost an adult yourself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Eu...⟪k:2⟫não posso fazer nenhuma promessa.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Eu tenho coisas a fazer — ⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫obrigações.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫E Nellie, você também é quase uma adulta."

#: scenario:scenario_A39F153A_73C7_459B_B747_63D03965ADA6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc62fc9f8881f6a79ea430026207fa3d5fece68fb19c45e1d796f95e2413bf25
#. default-sha256: e43740be3537ec970ccd93813a4c123db336c369b0776020abdcd4c28ccb446b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A39F153A_73C7_459B_B747_63D03965ADA6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Stop acting like such a child."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Pare de agir como uma criança."

#: scenario:scenario_353CAC4C_8617_486B_855D_4297A1FFF2F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed254886ec903dc5d7e3b9a7d46a65059c757fa048ce007343d8ef5b257bf64e
#. default-sha256: 8ea4aa4001c1cfc63638f0efd063b9aa0a0c3d1ad559f3ac2c4a5cc2c4096f1a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_353CAC4C_8617_486B_855D_4297A1FFF2F9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I’m not an adult yet!⟪k:2⟫I’m still a kid!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Não sou adulta ainda!⟪k:2⟫Ainda sou criança!"

#: scenario:scenario_37C57A29_53DC_4562_B66A_6A46209983BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 447c1161ba9723014faa09f597ee6ec77a29093829608404a22b9c1988191162
#. default-sha256: ac29a00594050a0310bae6ead15f892c8ab015c1c3440c6f418b50cc9cc3b5d5
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_37C57A29_53DC_4562_B66A_6A46209983BF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫If it means I don’t get to play with you anymore,⟪k:2⟫dearest Mell, then I don’t ⟪k:3⟫"
"want⟪k:4⟫ to be an adult!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Se isso significa que eu não posso mais brincar com você,⟪k:2⟫querido Mell, então eu "
"não ⟪k:3⟫quero⟪k:4⟫ ser adulta!"

#: scenario:scenario_C6699785_C044_4576_A771_11C8207F6A24
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 65613138ed1fc86b7bd996605982922468f27bd76c4a7058f88334918e7f116e
#. default-sha256: 930d24e9598d82685f2e6a2fc936220752d65626230f6dcc0f4245575bd32460
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_C6699785_C044_4576_A771_11C8207F6A24"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Nellie, you can’t—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Nellie, você não pode..."

#: scenario:scenario_7A37DB7D_81BA_4ED5_9A41_CBA0CCEDC531
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cc1759561499c0b277af50ff6376e328c61cf306d2d85bdb6abd08a1fe9d141c
